          "text": "Mbubonya mbwaakali acinswe kuciindi cakuzwa muzyalilo lyabanyina, ulapiluka mbuboobo. Taakwe cintu ncakonzya kutolelela camilimo yakwe yoonse njaakabeleka. ",
          "type": "text",
