        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa muntu Leza ngwapa buvubi ambono anguzu zyakulibotezya, kuti atambule caabilo cakwe akusekelela mumilimo yakwe, ncobeni eci ncaabilo ca-Leza, ",
